  "description": "Beginner-Friendly 150W Performance\nThe 150W motor delivers smooth acceleration and speeds up to 10 MPH, making it a fun and manageable choice for young riders ages 6–14.\n\nAdjustable as Kids Grow\nThe handlebar offers three adjustable heights from 33.5 to 37.4 inches, providing a comfortable fit for growing riders.\n\nColorful Light-Up Riding Fun\nFlashing wheels and colorful deck lights add excitement to every ride while helping young riders stay more visible.\n\nUp to 15 Miles per Charge\nEnjoy up to 15 miles of range, with a convenient magnetic charging connection and a charging time of approximately 2–3 hours.\n\nDual Braking & Easy Portability\nThe electronic brake and rear foot brake provide responsive stopping, while the 14.3 lb foldable design is easy for families to carry and store.",
